# site/ is where one property's project lives in this copy of Domus. Git ignores everything you add
# here, so a property's data, settings, options, tools and tests can't be published by accident.
# Only the generic examples below are tracked: copy one before you change it.
/*
!/.gitignore
!/README.md
!/AGENTS.md
!/tools/
/tools/*
!/tools/example.py
!/tests/
/tests/*
!/tests/conftest.py
!/tests/test_example.py
